Authoritative cumulative snapshot of ref/linux-7.1.5 at the cooperative-yield
bring-up checkpoint.  Generated against download/linux-7.1.5.tar.xz on
2026-08-01 after the full free-running test still froze the Windows host.

This file is intentionally not listed in series: it preserves the exact live
guest source while the incremental patch set is still being repaired.

